OL,3,GNEWSAWork to refurbish 'disgusting' bus
OL,4,Astation begins
OL,5,
OL,6,FWork to refurbish a major Surrey bus
OL,7,Fstation has begun.
OL,9,FDevelopers Berkeley told the BBC that
OL,10,Fmore than #4m was being invested in
OL,11,Fcreating a "modern, high-quality
OL,12,Ftransport hub" in Guildford town
OL,13,Fcentre.
OL,15,FThe new bus station is to include a new
OL,16,Fcanopy, refurbished concourse, new
OL,17,Fwaiting rooms, upgraded toilets and
OL,18,Fimproved office facilities, it added.
OL,20,FA new bus stand will also help improve
OL,21,Fcapacity, with work expected to be
OL,22,Fcompleted by the end of 2026.
OL,23,APub: 03-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
